:10:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T19:10:00Z","runtime":"60 min","description":"Blekingegadebanden er den autentiske beretning om en gruppe unge danske idealister, der mistede grebet om deres egen moral. De risikerede deres egen frihed, og andres liv og forlighed, for at skaffe penge til en sag, der var storre end dem selv. Det tidligere bandemedlem Bo Weymann fortller for forste gang om planlgningen af kup mod Posthuset i Herlev og Daells Varehus. Og om hans beslutning om at trde ud kort for det fatale roveri mod Kobmagergades Postkontor, der endte med drabet pa en ung betjent og afsloringen af bandes dklejlighed i Blekingegade. Instruktor: Anders Riis-Hansen Sendt forst"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795547400","title":"Hitlers handlangere","released":"2026-11-24T19:10:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T19:10:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T20:05:00Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795550700","title":"Den totale krig","released":"2026-11-24T20:05:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T20:05:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T21:00:00Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795554000","title":"Seneste nyt fra TV Avisen","released":"2026-11-24T21:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T21:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T21:15:00Z","runtime":"15 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795554900","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-11-24T21:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T21:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T21:45:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795556700","title":"Ghislaine Maxwell: Overgreb, logne og hemmeligheder","released":"2026-11-24T21:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T21:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T22:35:00Z","runtime":"50 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795559700","title":"Niels Bohr - danskeren der ndrede verden","released":"2026-11-24T22:35:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T22:35:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-24T23:20:00Z","runtime":"45 min","description":"I 1913 udviklede Niels Bohr sin geniale atommodel. Den star i dag som en af de mest banebrydende opdagelser i verdenshistorien. Hans atommodel er indirekte forudstningen for atombomben, men ogsa for de computere, lasere og mobiltelefoner, moderne mennesker er afhngige af i dag. Al informationsteknologi er saledes vokset ud af Bohrs opdagelse i 1913, og man anslar, at en tredjedel af verdensokonomien hviler pa kvantefysikken. Han var ikke kun en genial videnskabsmand, men ogsa en stor humanist, en renssancemand, en verdensborger, der omgik nogle af verdenshistoriens forende skikkelser. Niels Bo"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795562400","title":"Japans verdenskrig","released":"2026-11-24T23:20:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-24T23:20:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-25T00:10:00Z","runtime":"50 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795565400","title":"Julius Csar - En diktator fodes","released":"2026-11-25T00:10:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-25T00:10:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-25T01:05:00Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795568700","title":"Nonnen - 25 ar i kloster","released":"2026-11-25T01:05:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-25T01:05:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-25T02:45:00Z","runtime":"100 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795574700","title":"Pa skuldrene af Bohr","released":"2026-11-25T02:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-25T02:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-25T03:00:00Z","runtime":"15 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795575600","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-11-25T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-25T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-25T03:30:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795577400","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-11-25T03:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-25T03:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-25T04:00:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1795579200","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-11-25T04:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-25T04:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-25T04